"delivery.acknowledgedByCardholder","Does the pick-up or collection document carry an acknowledgment from the Cardholder or an authorized person that they collected the merchandise — a signature, PIN or collection code recorded at the point of collection? Count only a record of collection from a collection point rather than a delivery to an address; illustrative, not a closed list — a store, a locker, a depot. A carrier's proof of delivery signed at a delivery address is not a collection acknowledgment. Answer FALSE where the document shows the parcel was left without acknowledgment. Answer NOT_FOUND where the document does not show whether the goods were collected or delivered.","truth","DOCUMENT","proofOfDelivery","MERCHANT",NULL,"c7635bd9705",48,NULL
