"delivery.customsHoldingCountryRole","Whose country's customs agency does the delivery or customs record show is holding the merchandise? Answer exactly one of: MERCHANT_COUNTRY, CARDHOLDER_COUNTRY, OTHER_COUNTRY, NONE, UNKNOWN. The cardholder's country is inferred from the delivery address on the record; where the country holding the goods is the same as the merchant's country, answer UNKNOWN rather than choosing between MERCHANT_COUNTRY and CARDHOLDER_COUNTRY.","value","DOCUMENT","proofOfDelivery","EITHER","ENUM(MERCHANT_COUNTRY,CARDHOLDER_COUNTRY,OTHER_COUNTRY,NONE,UNKNOWN)","c0d31e7d011",51,NULL
